      "content": "it feels like there is nothing even left to save. people keep telling me to \"move on\" or \"find a new hobby,\" but that's not how it works. the person who could do those things is dead. i'm just a ghost walking around in a broken shell. if the ink has run dry like you said... then what's the point of just sitting here in the dark waiting for something that's never coming back?",
